  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "明天李总那边有个项目要谈，你俩跟我一起去什么项目啊？王姐，一千万哦，这么大，这个项目李总很重视，你俩跟着我说话，做事都注意点，没问题。王姐，放心吧，王姐肯定不给您丢脸。李总，好久不见。关于这个项目的核心技术壁垒，你们是如何考虑的？我们的技术团队已经完成了三代迭代，目前的方案在稳定性和成本控制上都具备行业领先优势。小张啊，你是第一个十来分钟就能把项目谈下来的人，真是后生可畏啊，哪里哪里还是我们王姐厉害，我就是个打辅助的合同，今天先不着急签。李总还有什么问题吗？没什么这么大的项目，我再考虑考虑。李总，这正好明天晚上我组了个局陈，总也会过来。王杰要是有时间一起吃个饭，李总邀请，那肯定有时间。行，那项目的事儿，咱们明天再聊。王姐，刚才项目不是都已经谈好了吗？合同都准备签了，李总怎么突然又说要考虑，你自己想想刚才说什么了，我也没说什么啊。李总夸我，我就是谦虚了一下，总不能人家夸我两句，我还真认了吧。李总夸你是认可你的能力，结果你倒好，自己先告诉人家，你就是个打辅助的这句话有什么问题。一千万的项目，你自己都不敢认自己的能力，你让客户怎么放心？就因为这一句话，很多时候人家看的不只是你会不会做事，也看你会不会跟人打交道。那这个项目是不是没戏了？还有机会，这个项目光提成都不止一百万。李总既然没有直接拒绝，还主动约了明天的饭局，就说明事情还有转机，能不能把这个项目拿下来，就看你们两个明天的表现了哟。王姐来了，快坐快坐，不好意思，让两位久等了，哪里哪里都是自己人。嗯嗯的。嗯，小张啊，今天高兴，刚好李总和陈总都在你来讲两句。那祝大家吃好喝。好，我先干了，领导们随意王姐，那我也借这个机会说两句。好，你说非常感谢李总今天组的局，也感谢王姐带我们过来，让我们有幸认识各位前辈，我叫琳琳。俗话说，相聚是一种缘分。此时此刻，我把对各位的祝福化作一杯美酒，祝各位扶摇直上。九万里事业长虹节节高。好，这姑娘会说话。好好好，王姐来这杯，我敬你。哎，陈总，这杯我替王姐敬您，我敬的是你们领导，你是领导吗？瞧您说的，您敬的是我领导，我同样敬的也是领导，您敬领导是心意，我敬您是尊敬这杯，我敬的是生意，咱们随意，祝您生意一路长虹，万事顺利。哈哈哈哈哈这小姑娘会说话，琳莲刚才说的不错，来咱俩喝一个，谢谢陈总，哎，怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。陈总平底酒，这叫发财酒，到底发财好事，再来好一个发财酒。琳琳，你这姑娘反应挺快，王姐手底下有你这样的员工省心啊。李总，您过奖了，主要是王姐平时带的好强将手下吴若斌，我总不能给我们王姐丢脸啊哈哈哈哈哈。王姐，你手底下这个姑娘不错，年轻人还得多跟您学习。哈哈哈哈哈哈王姐李总，昨天那个一千万的项目，我考虑好了，项目可以继续合作。不过我有个条件，李总，您说这个项目后面我希望让琳琳来负责。李总，我对小张的业务能力没问题，这一点昨天我就看出来了。不过这么大的项目后面少不了跟各种人打交道。今天晚上我也一直在观察你们两个这个项目，交给琳琳，我更放心，谢谢李总信任，也谢谢王姐，给我这个机会。后面有什么做的不到位的地方，还得请两位多指点，那就这么定了。琳琳李总那边合同已经确定了，后面这个项目你来负责，谢谢王姐，我一定把它做好，有不懂的地方随时问我，黄姐怎么了？这个项目前两天明明是我谈下来的，李总问的那些业务问题也是我回答的，为什么最后负责人却变成琳玲了？你真不知道为什么业务上你不比玲玲差，甚至前两天谈项目的时候，你表现的很好，可为什么都已经准备签合同了。李总突然又不签了，再想想昨天晚上的饭局，我突然让你讲两句，你说了什么？大家吃好喝。好，我先干了。陈总问玲玲，你是领导吗？如果换成你，你知道怎么接吗？陈总，杯子里知倒半杯酒，如果是你你的第一反应是什么？可能先跟陈总道歉，这就是区别。你不是能力不行，是这么大的项目，除了把事情做好，还要面对客户、合作方，还有各种突发情况。李总最后选琳琳，不是因为她比你会说几句漂亮话，是因为昨天晚上他都在看你们两个人遇到事情的时候怎么处理，别光想着自己为什么没拿到，好好想想玲玲为什么能拿到练练，刚才我确实有点不服。嗯，毕竟这个项目前两天是我谈的，李总问的那些业务问题也是我回答的。但是王姐刚才说完，我仔细想了想，我好像明白李总为什么最后选你了。为什么业务上的问题我会回答。可一碰到这种突发情况，我就嘴笨反应慢，但有件事我还是没想明白什么。李总夸我的时候，我把功劳给了王姐。后来李总夸你的时候，你也把功劳给了王姐。可我说完，人家合同都不想签了。你说完，人家反而越来越认可你。因为谦虚不等于否定自己啊，你可以抬高别人，但是没必要把自己压下去。什么意思？比如那天李总夸你，后生可畏，你完全可以说李总过奖了。要不是您愿意给机会，我哪能跟您这么有魄力的人合作啊，以后还得跟您多学呢。这样既没有把功劳全揽到自己身上，也没有把自己说的一文不值。可是还有个问题，昨天陈总突然问你，你是领导吗？还有倒酒突然只剩半杯，这些又没人提前告诉你，你为什么每次马上就知道怎么接。你别告诉我这些全都是林场想的。当然不是，那你到底是怎么练的？其实我以前跟你一样，不爱说话，不爱争辩，一到这种场合就不知道应该说什么。后来我就经常看这本闲谈高手，它里面就是一个场景，一个场景的告诉你，遇到不同的人不同的话应该怎么接。比如，别人夸你优秀，你可以回，那是不优秀点儿，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当别人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说，辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下吴若兵，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？难怪你每次都能接的这么快，这种东西不是天生的，就是平时一个场景，一个场景的看，一个场景，一个场景的练。每天看两页，慢慢积累一些不同的场景之下，应该怎么说。所以你平时就是这么练的对啊，每天不用看很多看两页，碰到自己觉得有用的表达就记一记慢慢积累的多了。工作和生活里再碰到类似的场景，你就知道怎么接了。这本先借我看看，拿去吧，回去慢慢看。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00001",
      "start_ms": 830,
      "end_ms": 2610,
      "text": "明天李总那边有个项目要谈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2610,
      "end_ms": 4650,
      "text": "你俩跟我一起去什么项目啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4650,
      "end_ms": 5070,
      "text": "王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6950,
      "end_ms": 8430,
      "text": "一千万哦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9110,
      "end_ms": 9790,
      "text": "这么大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10210,
      "end_ms": 11890,
      "text": "这个项目李总很重视，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00007",
      "start_ms": 12170,
      "end_ms": 13730,
      "text": "你俩跟着我说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13750,
      "end_ms": 14810,
      "text": "做事都注意点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00009",
      "start_ms": 14990,
      "end_ms": 15390,
      "text": "没问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00010",
      "start_ms": 15390,
      "end_ms": 15810,
      "text": "王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00011",
      "start_ms": 15950,
      "end_ms": 16370,
      "text": "放心吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00012",
      "start_ms": 16370,
      "end_ms": 17785,
      "text": "王姐肯定不给您丢脸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00013",
      "start_ms": 22710,
      "end_ms": 23150,
      "text": "李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00014",
      "start_ms": 23190,
      "end_ms": 23910,
      "text": "好久不见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00015",
      "start_ms": 24230,
      "end_ms": 26130,
      "text": "关于这个项目的核心技术壁垒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00016",
      "start_ms": 26130,
      "end_ms": 27130,
      "text": "你们是如何考虑的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00017",
      "start_ms": 27330,
      "end_ms": 29570,
      "text": "我们的技术团队已经完成了三代迭代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00018",
      "start_ms": 29850,
      "end_ms": 33505,
      "text": "目前的方案在稳定性和成本控制上都具备行业领先优势。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00019",
      "start_ms": 35790,
      "end_ms": 36370,
      "text": "小张啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00020",
      "start_ms": 37090,
      "end_ms": 40130,
      "text": "你是第一个十来分钟就能把项目谈下来的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00021",
      "start_ms": 40810,
      "end_ms": 41970,
      "text": "真是后生可畏啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00022",
      "start_ms": 42470,
      "end_ms": 44950,
      "text": "哪里哪里还是我们王姐厉害，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00023",
      "start_ms": 45310,
      "end_ms": 51110,
      "text": "我就是个打辅助的合同，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00024",
      "start_ms": 51110,
      "end_ms": 52110,
      "text": "今天先不着急签。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00025",
      "start_ms": 52470,
      "end_ms": 54070,
      "text": "李总还有什么问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00026",
      "start_ms": 54310,
      "end_ms": 56930,
      "text": "没什么这么大的项目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00027",
      "start_ms": 57250,
      "end_ms": 58170,
      "text": "我再考虑考虑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00028",
      "start_ms": 58590,
      "end_ms": 59010,
      "text": "李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00029",
      "start_ms": 59130,
      "end_ms": 62590,
      "text": "这正好明天晚上我组了个局陈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00030",
      "start_ms": 62590,
      "end_ms": 63325,
      "text": "总也会过来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00031",
      "start_ms": 63830,
      "end_ms": 65965,
      "text": "王杰要是有时间一起吃个饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00032",
      "start_ms": 66970,
      "end_ms": 67810,
      "text": "李总邀请，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00033",
      "start_ms": 67890,
      "end_ms": 68995,
      "text": "那肯定有时间。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00034",
      "start_ms": 70360,
      "end_ms": 70605,
      "text": "行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00035",
      "start_ms": 71360,
      "end_ms": 72480,
      "text": "那项目的事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00036",
      "start_ms": 72500,
      "end_ms": 73425,
      "text": "咱们明天再聊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00037",
      "start_ms": 76380,
      "end_ms": 76835,
      "text": "王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00038",
      "start_ms": 79270,
      "end_ms": 81090,
      "text": "刚才项目不是都已经谈好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00039",
      "start_ms": 81330,
      "end_ms": 82535,
      "text": "合同都准备签了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00040",
      "start_ms": 82980,
      "end_ms": 84375,
      "text": "李总怎么突然又说要考虑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00041",
      "start_ms": 84900,
      "end_ms": 86745,
      "text": "你自己想想刚才说什么了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00042",
      "start_ms": 86950,
      "end_ms": 88095,
      "text": "我也没说什么啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00043",
      "start_ms": 88450,
      "end_ms": 89130,
      "text": "李总夸我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00044",
      "start_ms": 89130,
      "end_ms": 90135,
      "text": "我就是谦虚了一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00045",
      "start_ms": 90610,
      "end_ms": 91810,
      "text": "总不能人家夸我两句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00046",
      "start_ms": 91810,
      "end_ms": 92630,
      "text": "我还真认了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00047",
      "start_ms": 92730,
      "end_ms": 95370,
      "text": "李总夸你是认可你的能力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00048",
      "start_ms": 95830,
      "end_ms": 96690,
      "text": "结果你倒好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00049",
      "start_ms": 96910,
      "end_ms": 98230,
      "text": "自己先告诉人家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00050",
      "start_ms": 98290,
      "end_ms": 101715,
      "text": "你就是个打辅助的这句话有什么问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00051",
      "start_ms": 101940,
      "end_ms": 102935,
      "text": "一千万的项目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00052",
      "start_ms": 103460,
      "end_ms": 104980,
      "text": "你自己都不敢认自己的能力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00053",
      "start_ms": 105060,
      "end_ms": 106245,
      "text": "你让客户怎么放心？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00054",
      "start_ms": 107940,
      "end_ms": 108880,
      "text": "就因为这一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00055",
      "start_ms": 109100,
      "end_ms": 111995,
      "text": "很多时候人家看的不只是你会不会做事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00056",
      "start_ms": 112590,
      "end_ms": 114225,
      "text": "也看你会不会跟人打交道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00057",
      "start_ms": 115270,
      "end_ms": 116850,
      "text": "那这个项目是不是没戏了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00058",
      "start_ms": 116850,
      "end_ms": 117575,
      "text": "还有机会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00059",
      "start_ms": 117880,
      "end_ms": 119925,
      "text": "这个项目光提成都不止一百万。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00060",
      "start_ms": 120640,
      "end_ms": 122300,
      "text": "李总既然没有直接拒绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00061",
      "start_ms": 122480,
      "end_ms": 124055,
      "text": "还主动约了明天的饭局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00062",
      "start_ms": 124390,
      "end_ms": 125695,
      "text": "就说明事情还有转机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00063",
      "start_ms": 126090,
      "end_ms": 127630,
      "text": "能不能把这个项目拿下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00064",
      "start_ms": 127710,
      "end_ms": 133920,
      "text": "就看你们两个明天的表现了哟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00065",
      "start_ms": 134100,
      "end_ms": 134940,
      "text": "王姐来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00066",
      "start_ms": 135020,
      "end_ms": 135885,
      "text": "快坐快坐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00067",
      "start_ms": 136610,
      "end_ms": 137345,
      "text": "不好意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00068",
      "start_ms": 137720,
      "end_ms": 138880,
      "text": "让两位久等了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00069",
      "start_ms": 139080,
      "end_ms": 140845,
      "text": "哪里哪里都是自己人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00070",
      "start_ms": 141440,
      "end_ms": 142055,
      "text": "嗯嗯的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00071",
      "start_ms": 142450,
      "end_ms": 142700,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00072",
      "start_ms": 148080,
      "end_ms": 148775,
      "text": "小张啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00073",
      "start_ms": 149320,
      "end_ms": 150040,
      "text": "今天高兴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00074",
      "start_ms": 150320,
      "end_ms": 152740,
      "text": "刚好李总和陈总都在你来讲两句。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00075",
      "start_ms": 152820,
      "end_ms": 154700,
      "text": "那祝大家吃好喝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00076",
      "start_ms": 154700,
      "end_ms": 154880,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00077",
      "start_ms": 154880,
      "end_ms": 155340,
      "text": "我先干了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00078",
      "start_ms": 155340,
      "end_ms": 166570,
      "text": "领导们随意王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00079",
      "start_ms": 166790,
      "end_ms": 168335,
      "text": "那我也借这个机会说两句。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00080",
      "start_ms": 168630,
      "end_ms": 168995,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00081",
      "start_ms": 169500,
      "end_ms": 171840,
      "text": "你说非常感谢李总今天组的局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00082",
      "start_ms": 171980,
      "end_ms": 173440,
      "text": "也感谢王姐带我们过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00083",
      "start_ms": 173460,
      "end_ms": 174860,
      "text": "让我们有幸认识各位前辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00084",
      "start_ms": 175120,
      "end_ms": 175875,
      "text": "我叫琳琳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00085",
      "start_ms": 176270,
      "end_ms": 176830,
      "text": "俗话说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00086",
      "start_ms": 176990,
      "end_ms": 178130,
      "text": "相聚是一种缘分。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00087",
      "start_ms": 178430,
      "end_ms": 179090,
      "text": "此时此刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00088",
      "start_ms": 179230,
      "end_ms": 181535,
      "text": "我把对各位的祝福化作一杯美酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00089",
      "start_ms": 181820,
      "end_ms": 182860,
      "text": "祝各位扶摇直上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00090",
      "start_ms": 182860,
      "end_ms": 184900,
      "text": "九万里事业长虹节节高。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00091",
      "start_ms": 186120,
      "end_ms": 186555,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00092",
      "start_ms": 187000,
      "end_ms": 188205,
      "text": "这姑娘会说话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00093",
      "start_ms": 192970,
      "end_ms": 193635,
      "text": "好好好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00094",
      "start_ms": 194960,
      "end_ms": 196430,
      "text": "王姐来这杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00095",
      "start_ms": 196430,
      "end_ms": 196945,
      "text": "我敬你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00096",
      "start_ms": 197200,
      "end_ms": 197425,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00097",
      "start_ms": 200010,
      "end_ms": 200545,
      "text": "陈总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00098",
      "start_ms": 200920,
      "end_ms": 202045,
      "text": "这杯我替王姐敬您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00099",
      "start_ms": 203420,
      "end_ms": 204745,
      "text": "我敬的是你们领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00100",
      "start_ms": 205520,
      "end_ms": 206425,
      "text": "你是领导吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00101",
      "start_ms": 207200,
      "end_ms": 207995,
      "text": "瞧您说的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00102",
      "start_ms": 208440,
      "end_ms": 209560,
      "text": "您敬的是我领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00103",
      "start_ms": 209640,
      "end_ms": 211465,
      "text": "我同样敬的也是领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00104",
      "start_ms": 211780,
      "end_ms": 212860,
      "text": "您敬领导是心意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00105",
      "start_ms": 213060,
      "end_ms": 214960,
      "text": "我敬您是尊敬这杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00106",
      "start_ms": 214960,
      "end_ms": 215820,
      "text": "我敬的是生意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00107",
      "start_ms": 215900,
      "end_ms": 216575,
      "text": "咱们随意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00108",
      "start_ms": 216830,
      "end_ms": 218090,
      "text": "祝您生意一路长虹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00109",
      "start_ms": 218170,
      "end_ms": 218905,
      "text": "万事顺利。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00110",
      "start_ms": 219290,
      "end_ms": 222050,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈这小姑娘会说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00111",
      "start_ms": 222130,
      "end_ms": 223740,
      "text": "琳莲刚才说的不错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00112",
      "start_ms": 223860,
      "end_ms": 224660,
      "text": "来咱俩喝一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00113",
      "start_ms": 224660,
      "end_ms": 225265,
      "text": "谢谢陈总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00114",
      "start_ms": 228020,
      "end_ms": 228305,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00115",
      "start_ms": 229060,
      "end_ms": 230425,
      "text": "怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00116",
      "start_ms": 230690,
      "end_ms": 231880,
      "text": "陈总平底酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00117",
      "start_ms": 231880,
      "end_ms": 232735,
      "text": "这叫发财酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00118",
      "start_ms": 233080,
      "end_ms": 234040,
      "text": "到底发财好事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00119",
      "start_ms": 234040,
      "end_ms": 237050,
      "text": "再来好一个发财酒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00120",
      "start_ms": 237210,
      "end_ms": 237715,
      "text": "琳琳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00121",
      "start_ms": 238490,
      "end_ms": 240025,
      "text": "你这姑娘反应挺快，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00122",
      "start_ms": 240460,
      "end_ms": 243565,
      "text": "王姐手底下有你这样的员工省心啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00123",
      "start_ms": 244090,
      "end_ms": 244470,
      "text": "李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00124",
      "start_ms": 244470,
      "end_ms": 245175,
      "text": "您过奖了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00125",
      "start_ms": 245480,
      "end_ms": 248795,
      "text": "主要是王姐平时带的好强将手下吴若斌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00126",
      "start_ms": 249150,
      "end_ms": 252675,
      "text": "我总不能给我们王姐丢脸啊哈哈哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00127",
      "start_ms": 253180,
      "end_ms": 253725,
      "text": "王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00128",
      "start_ms": 254090,
      "end_ms": 255595,
      "text": "你手底下这个姑娘不错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00129",
      "start_ms": 256530,
      "end_ms": 258555,
      "text": "年轻人还得多跟您学习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00130",
      "start_ms": 261040,
      "end_ms": 265405,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈王姐李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00131",
      "start_ms": 266340,
      "end_ms": 268345,
      "text": "昨天那个一千万的项目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00132",
      "start_ms": 269950,
      "end_ms": 270945,
      "text": "我考虑好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00133",
      "start_ms": 271520,
      "end_ms": 272715,
      "text": "项目可以继续合作。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00134",
      "start_ms": 273150,
      "end_ms": 274025,
      "text": "不过我有个条件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00135",
      "start_ms": 274850,
      "end_ms": 275290,
      "text": "李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00136",
      "start_ms": 275350,
      "end_ms": 279005,
      "text": "您说这个项目后面我希望让琳琳来负责。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00137",
      "start_ms": 281450,
      "end_ms": 282025,
      "text": "李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00138",
      "start_ms": 282450,
      "end_ms": 284995,
      "text": "我对小张的业务能力没问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00139",
      "start_ms": 285460,
      "end_ms": 286935,
      "text": "这一点昨天我就看出来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00140",
      "start_ms": 287670,
      "end_ms": 290830,
      "text": "不过这么大的项目后面少不了跟各种人打交道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00141",
      "start_ms": 290930,
      "end_ms": 294180,
      "text": "今天晚上我也一直在观察你们两个这个项目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00142",
      "start_ms": 294180,
      "end_ms": 294760,
      "text": "交给琳琳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00143",
      "start_ms": 294760,
      "end_ms": 295395,
      "text": "我更放心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00144",
      "start_ms": 296360,
      "end_ms": 297335,
      "text": "谢谢李总信任，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00145",
      "start_ms": 297610,
      "end_ms": 298250,
      "text": "也谢谢王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00146",
      "start_ms": 298250,
      "end_ms": 298925,
      "text": "给我这个机会。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00147",
      "start_ms": 299250,
      "end_ms": 300630,
      "text": "后面有什么做的不到位的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00148",
      "start_ms": 300670,
      "end_ms": 301710,
      "text": "还得请两位多指点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00149",
      "start_ms": 301710,
      "end_ms": 302465,
      "text": "那就这么定了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00150",
      "start_ms": 305880,
      "end_ms": 308780,
      "text": "琳琳李总那边合同已经确定了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00151",
      "start_ms": 309060,
      "end_ms": 310700,
      "text": "后面这个项目你来负责，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00152",
      "start_ms": 311160,
      "end_ms": 311820,
      "text": "谢谢王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00153",
      "start_ms": 311960,
      "end_ms": 312900,
      "text": "我一定把它做好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00154",
      "start_ms": 313080,
      "end_ms": 314435,
      "text": "有不懂的地方随时问我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00155",
      "start_ms": 317580,
      "end_ms": 319840,
      "text": "黄姐怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00156",
      "start_ms": 320140,
      "end_ms": 322460,
      "text": "这个项目前两天明明是我谈下来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00157",
      "start_ms": 322980,
      "end_ms": 325319,
      "text": "李总问的那些业务问题也是我回答的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00158",
      "start_ms": 326020,
      "end_ms": 328180,
      "text": "为什么最后负责人却变成琳玲了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00159",
      "start_ms": 328340,
      "end_ms": 334660,
      "text": "你真不知道为什么业务上你不比玲玲差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00160",
      "start_ms": 335160,
      "end_ms": 336820,
      "text": "甚至前两天谈项目的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00161",
      "start_ms": 336820,
      "end_ms": 337660,
      "text": "你表现的很好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00162",
      "start_ms": 338140,
      "end_ms": 339980,
      "text": "可为什么都已经准备签合同了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00163",
      "start_ms": 340360,
      "end_ms": 341720,
      "text": "李总突然又不签了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00164",
      "start_ms": 342460,
      "end_ms": 344000,
      "text": "再想想昨天晚上的饭局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00165",
      "start_ms": 344720,
      "end_ms": 346020,
      "text": "我突然让你讲两句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00166",
      "start_ms": 346200,
      "end_ms": 346980,
      "text": "你说了什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00167",
      "start_ms": 347000,
      "end_ms": 347700,
      "text": "大家吃好喝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00168",
      "start_ms": 347700,
      "end_ms": 347940,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00169",
      "start_ms": 348080,
      "end_ms": 348780,
      "text": "我先干了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00170",
      "start_ms": 348920,
      "end_ms": 349800,
      "text": "陈总问玲玲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00171",
      "start_ms": 349900,
      "end_ms": 350820,
      "text": "你是领导吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00172",
      "start_ms": 350940,
      "end_ms": 351760,
      "text": "如果换成你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00173",
      "start_ms": 351840,
      "end_ms": 352900,
      "text": "你知道怎么接吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00174",
      "start_ms": 354140,
      "end_ms": 354600,
      "text": "陈总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00175",
      "start_ms": 354600,
      "end_ms": 355660,
      "text": "杯子里知倒半杯酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00176",
      "start_ms": 355660,
      "end_ms": 358235,
      "text": "如果是你你的第一反应是什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00177",
      "start_ms": 359670,
      "end_ms": 361565,
      "text": "可能先跟陈总道歉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00178",
      "start_ms": 361920,
      "end_ms": 362855,
      "text": "这就是区别。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00179",
      "start_ms": 363330,
      "end_ms": 364395,
      "text": "你不是能力不行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00180",
      "start_ms": 364840,
      "end_ms": 365900,
      "text": "是这么大的项目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00181",
      "start_ms": 366020,
      "end_ms": 367020,
      "text": "除了把事情做好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00182",
      "start_ms": 367320,
      "end_ms": 369160,
      "text": "还要面对客户、合作方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00183",
      "start_ms": 369240,
      "end_ms": 370545,
      "text": "还有各种突发情况。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00184",
      "start_ms": 371600,
      "end_ms": 372800,
      "text": "李总最后选琳琳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00185",
      "start_ms": 372880,
      "end_ms": 375005,
      "text": "不是因为她比你会说几句漂亮话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00186",
      "start_ms": 375600,
      "end_ms": 379975,
      "text": "是因为昨天晚上他都在看你们两个人遇到事情的时候怎么处理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00187",
      "start_ms": 381150,
      "end_ms": 383265,
      "text": "别光想着自己为什么没拿到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00188",
      "start_ms": 383920,
      "end_ms": 391570,
      "text": "好好想想玲玲为什么能拿到练练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00189",
      "start_ms": 391680,
      "end_ms": 392740,
      "text": "刚才我确实有点不服。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00190",
      "start_ms": 392800,
      "end_ms": 393105,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00191",
      "start_ms": 393360,
      "end_ms": 394805,
      "text": "毕竟这个项目前两天是我谈的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00192",
      "start_ms": 394980,
      "end_ms": 396875,
      "text": "李总问的那些业务问题也是我回答的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00193",
      "start_ms": 397590,
      "end_ms": 398710,
      "text": "但是王姐刚才说完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00194",
      "start_ms": 398870,
      "end_ms": 399825,
      "text": "我仔细想了想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00195",
      "start_ms": 400410,
      "end_ms": 402305,
      "text": "我好像明白李总为什么最后选你了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00196",
      "start_ms": 402580,
      "end_ms": 405390,
      "text": "为什么业务上的问题我会回答。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00197",
      "start_ms": 405590,
      "end_ms": 406930,
      "text": "可一碰到这种突发情况，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00198",
      "start_ms": 406930,
      "end_ms": 408315,
      "text": "我就嘴笨反应慢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00199",
      "start_ms": 408970,
      "end_ms": 411280,
      "text": "但有件事我还是没想明白什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00200",
      "start_ms": 411420,
      "end_ms": 412400,
      "text": "李总夸我的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00201",
      "start_ms": 412400,
      "end_ms": 413465,
      "text": "我把功劳给了王姐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00202",
      "start_ms": 413680,
      "end_ms": 414620,
      "text": "后来李总夸你的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00203",
      "start_ms": 414620,
      "end_ms": 415725,
      "text": "你也把功劳给了王姐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00204",
      "start_ms": 416010,
      "end_ms": 416670,
      "text": "可我说完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00205",
      "start_ms": 416690,
      "end_ms": 418005,
      "text": "人家合同都不想签了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00206",
      "start_ms": 418390,
      "end_ms": 418930,
      "text": "你说完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00207",
      "start_ms": 418930,
      "end_ms": 420125,
      "text": "人家反而越来越认可你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00208",
      "start_ms": 420470,
      "end_ms": 423125,
      "text": "因为谦虚不等于否定自己啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00209",
      "start_ms": 423490,
      "end_ms": 424535,
      "text": "你可以抬高别人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00210",
      "start_ms": 424840,
      "end_ms": 426280,
      "text": "但是没必要把自己压下去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00211",
      "start_ms": 426420,
      "end_ms": 427005,
      "text": "什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00212",
      "start_ms": 427230,
      "end_ms": 428570,
      "text": "比如那天李总夸你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00213",
      "start_ms": 428590,
      "end_ms": 429350,
      "text": "后生可畏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00214",
      "start_ms": 429510,
      "end_ms": 431375,
      "text": "你完全可以说李总过奖了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00215",
      "start_ms": 431660,
      "end_ms": 432940,
      "text": "要不是您愿意给机会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00216",
      "start_ms": 433080,
      "end_ms": 435055,
      "text": "我哪能跟您这么有魄力的人合作啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00217",
      "start_ms": 435300,
      "end_ms": 436725,
      "text": "以后还得跟您多学呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00218",
      "start_ms": 437030,
      "end_ms": 439410,
      "text": "这样既没有把功劳全揽到自己身上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00219",
      "start_ms": 439510,
      "end_ms": 441275,
      "text": "也没有把自己说的一文不值。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00220",
      "start_ms": 441770,
      "end_ms": 442595,
      "text": "可是还有个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00221",
      "start_ms": 443350,
      "end_ms": 444530,
      "text": "昨天陈总突然问你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00222",
      "start_ms": 444730,
      "end_ms": 445530,
      "text": "你是领导吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00223",
      "start_ms": 445690,
      "end_ms": 447185,
      "text": "还有倒酒突然只剩半杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00224",
      "start_ms": 447630,
      "end_ms": 448925,
      "text": "这些又没人提前告诉你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00225",
      "start_ms": 449590,
      "end_ms": 451435,
      "text": "你为什么每次马上就知道怎么接。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00226",
      "start_ms": 452360,
      "end_ms": 454320,
      "text": "你别告诉我这些全都是林场想的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00227",
      "start_ms": 454480,
      "end_ms": 455285,
      "text": "当然不是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00228",
      "start_ms": 455730,
      "end_ms": 457075,
      "text": "那你到底是怎么练的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00229",
      "start_ms": 457830,
      "end_ms": 459295,
      "text": "其实我以前跟你一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00230",
      "start_ms": 459760,
      "end_ms": 460520,
      "text": "不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00231",
      "start_ms": 460700,
      "end_ms": 461525,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00232",
      "start_ms": 461890,
      "end_ms": 464415,
      "text": "一到这种场合就不知道应该说什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00233",
      "start_ms": 464910,
      "end_ms": 467365,
      "text": "后来我就经常看这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00234",
      "start_ms": 467790,
      "end_ms": 469150,
      "text": "它里面就是一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00235",
      "start_ms": 469150,
      "end_ms": 470425,
      "text": "一个场景的告诉你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00236",
      "start_ms": 470660,
      "end_ms": 473035,
      "text": "遇到不同的人不同的话应该怎么接。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00237",
      "start_ms": 473580,
      "end_ms": 474040,
      "text": "比如，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00238",
      "start_ms": 474430,
      "end_ms": 475430,
      "text": "别人夸你优秀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00239",
      "start_ms": 475670,
      "end_ms": 476465,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00240",
      "start_ms": 476920,
      "end_ms": 478140,
      "text": "那是不优秀点儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00241",
      "start_ms": 478140,
      "end_ms": 479380,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00242",
      "start_ms": 479580,
      "end_ms": 480980,
      "text": "当别人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00243",
      "start_ms": 481000,
      "end_ms": 482540,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00244",
      "start_ms": 482660,
      "end_ms": 483580,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00245",
      "start_ms": 483580,
      "end_ms": 485970,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00246",
      "start_ms": 485970,
      "end_ms": 486590,
      "text": "辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00247",
      "start_ms": 486730,
      "end_ms": 487950,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00248",
      "start_ms": 488190,
      "end_ms": 489515,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00249",
      "start_ms": 489750,
      "end_ms": 491030,
      "text": "强将手下吴若兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00250",
      "start_ms": 491150,
      "end_ms": 492490,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00251",
      "start_ms": 492690,
      "end_ms": 494625,
      "text": "难怪你每次都能接的这么快，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00252",
      "start_ms": 495100,
      "end_ms": 496725,
      "text": "这种东西不是天生的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00253",
      "start_ms": 497070,
      "end_ms": 498450,
      "text": "就是平时一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00254",
      "start_ms": 498450,
      "end_ms": 499210,
      "text": "一个场景的看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00255",
      "start_ms": 499430,
      "end_ms": 499990,
      "text": "一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00256",
      "start_ms": 499990,
      "end_ms": 500865,
      "text": "一个场景的练。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00257",
      "start_ms": 501350,
      "end_ms": 502295,
      "text": "每天看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00258",
      "start_ms": 502650,
      "end_ms": 504630,
      "text": "慢慢积累一些不同的场景之下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00259",
      "start_ms": 504630,
      "end_ms": 505495,
      "text": "应该怎么说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00260",
      "start_ms": 505970,
      "end_ms": 507995,
      "text": "所以你平时就是这么练的对啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00261",
      "start_ms": 508400,
      "end_ms": 510140,
      "text": "每天不用看很多看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00262",
      "start_ms": 510220,
      "end_ms": 513760,
      "text": "碰到自己觉得有用的表达就记一记慢慢积累的多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00263",
      "start_ms": 513780,
      "end_ms": 515845,
      "text": "工作和生活里再碰到类似的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00264",
      "start_ms": 516060,
      "end_ms": 517255,
      "text": "你就知道怎么接了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00265",
      "start_ms": 517930,
      "end_ms": 518855,
      "text": "这本先借我看看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaa1f34d8a000b69_s00266",
      "start_ms": 519420,
      "end_ms": 519960,
      "text": "拿去吧，"
    },
    {
